-- Creature texts that have no broadcast text were stored in Russian (often mis-encoded) or German by an old
-- import and shown to players as is. Each is replaced by an English line, and a French one is added to
-- creature_text_locale, read by the core for texts without a broadcast text. Lines sharing a group and index
-- get a free index, since creature_text_locale is keyed by group and index. A translation that matches an
-- official line word for word takes that broadcast text instead, so the client shows the official French.
-- Five English lines imported from TDB by the previous file, without broadcast text, get their French here.
